      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Perched at about 4,400 feet, Hartland enjoys a hot‑summer Mediterranean climate with mild wet winters, hot dry summers, and occasional snowfall.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        10,
        21,
        29
