      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/hartland_california",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Before European arrival, the area that is now Hartland was part of the traditional territory of the Yokuts, who inhabited the San Joaquin Valley for thousands of years.",
